<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers following the weekly movement of 80,200 head. Sales reported on 3,100 slaughter steers and 1,400 slaughter heifers.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1150-1200 lbs 66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1050-1100 lbs 66.00. Pen select, few choice 2-3 1100 lbs 65.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:   4,500    Week Ago:    None    Year Ago: 49,500</p>
